  "details": "After the latest update, My microphone on the quest 3 is being treated as if it's quiet on VRChat. When during small lag-spikes, my microphone just stops working until I open my quest menu. None of these normally happened until the latest update released on the Meta Quest headsets Yesterday. My mic threshold has always been at 7%, but now I have to set it to 3$ and have people complain about them echoing while talking with me. Please fix this as it is very irritating. Two videos were attached for proof of these claims.",
